#: bot/__init__.py:223 bot/__init__.py:286
msgid ""
"This needs Google Chrome, which is not available on this machine's "
"processor architecture."
msgstr ""
"Ini memerlukan Google Chrome, yang tidak tersedia untuk arsitektur "
"prosesor mesin ini."

#: bot/__init__.py:268
msgid "Spotify is unavailable: the player could not start."
msgstr "Spotify tidak tersedia: pemutar tidak bisa dimulai."

#: bot/__init__.py:301 bot/__init__.py:304 bot/modules/portal_pages.py:543
msgid "The sign-in did not complete."
msgstr "Proses masuk tidak selesai."

#: bot/__init__.py:317
msgid ""
"The account portal is switched off in this bot's configuration, so "
"Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music and Amazon Music cannot be connected. "
"Set auth_portal.enabled to true in this bot's config.json and restart it."
" If the manager switched it off for a port clash, there is a file named "
"PORT_CONFLICT.txt in the bot's folder explaining it, and Repair Account "
"Portal and Spotify Ports in the manager turns it back on."
msgstr ""
"Portal akun dinonaktifkan di konfigurasi bot ini, jadi Netflix, Disney "
"Plus, Apple Music, dan Amazon Music tidak bisa dihubungkan. Atur "
"auth_portal.enabled menjadi true di config.json bot ini lalu mulai ulang."
" Jika pengelola menonaktifkannya karena bentrok port, ada berkas bernama "
"PORT_CONFLICT.txt di folder bot yang menjelaskannya, dan opsi Repair "
"Account Portal and Spotify Ports di pengelola akan mengaktifkannya lagi."

#: bot/__init__.py:370
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The account portal could not start because port %(port)s is already in "
"use, most likely by another bot on this machine. Netflix, Disney Plus, "
"Apple Music and Amazon Music cannot be connected until that is fixed. Run"
" the manager, choose Manage Bots, then Repair Account Portal and Spotify "
"Ports, and restart this bot. YouTube and Spotify are unaffected, because "
"they sign in with a code in the channel."
msgstr ""
"Portal akun tidak bisa dimulai karena port %(port)s sudah dipakai, "
"kemungkinan besar oleh bot lain di mesin ini. Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple"
" Music, dan Amazon Music tidak bisa dihubungkan sampai ini diperbaiki. "
"Jalankan pengelola, pilih Manage Bots, lalu Repair Account Portal and "
"Spotify Ports, dan mulai ulang bot ini. YouTube dan Spotify tidak "
"terpengaruh, karena keduanya masuk dengan kode di saluran."

#: bot/__init__.py:380
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The account portal could not start, so Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music "
"and Amazon Music cannot be connected. The reason is in this bot's log "
"file: %(reason)s"
msgstr ""
"Portal akun tidak bisa dimulai, jadi Netflix, Disney Plus, Apple Music, "
"dan Amazon Music tidak bisa dihubungkan. Alasannya ada di berkas log bot "
"ini: %(reason)s"

#: bot/__init__.py:412
msgid ""
"Hello! I'm back and ready for you to stream again. Thank you for your "
"patience!"
msgstr ""
"Halo! Saya sudah kembali dan siap untuk siaran lagi. Terima kasih atas "
"kesabarannya!"

#: bot/__init__.py:452
msgid ""
"Hello there! It's me, the Streamer Bot, just coming in here to let you "
"know that an update is in progress and I will restart in a few moments to"
" apply it. Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"Halo! Ini saya, Streamer Bot, mampir untuk memberi tahu bahwa pembaruan "
"sedang berjalan dan saya akan mulai ulang sebentar lagi untuk "
"menerapkannya. Terima kasih!"

#: bot/__init__.py:497
msgid "Restarted. The new settings are in use."
msgstr "Sudah dimulai ulang. Pengaturan baru sudah dipakai."

#: bot/__init__.py:537
msgid "The bot is restarting now to apply the update. See you in a moment!"
msgstr ""
"Bot sedang memulai ulang sekarang untuk menerapkan pembaruan. Sampai "
"jumpa lagi!"

#: bot/app_vars.py:44
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"StreamerBot for TeamTalk 5.\n"
"Streams YouTube, YouTube Music, Spotify, Apple Music, Amazon Music, "
"Netflix,\n"
"Disney Plus and direct links into a channel, with audio description "
"support.\n"
"Repository: {repo}\n"
"TeamTalk SDK {sdk}.\n"
"Based on TTMediaBot by Amir Gumerov, Vladislav Kopylov, Beqa Gozalishvili"
" and\n"
"Kirill Belousov, and on the fork by Joao Almeida.\n"
msgstr ""
"StreamerBot untuk TeamTalk 5.\n"
"Menyiarkan YouTube, YouTube Music, Spotify, Apple Music, Amazon Music, "
"Netflix,\n"
"Disney Plus, dan tautan langsung ke sebuah saluran, dengan dukungan "
"deskripsi audio.\n"
"Repositori: {repo}\n"
"TeamTalk SDK {sdk}.\n"
"Berdasarkan TTMediaBot karya Amir Gumerov, Vladislav Kopylov, Beqa "
"Gozalishvili, dan\n"
"Kirill Belousov, serta fork karya Joao Almeida.\n"

