msgid ""
"Spotify search needs a Spotify application. Add a client ID and secret in"
" the bot's configuration, then try again. Playing a pasted Spotify link "
"does not need one."
msgstr ""
"Pencarian Spotify memerlukan aplikasi Spotify. Tambahkan ID klien dan "
"secret di konfigurasi bot, lalu coba lagi. Memutar tautan Spotify yang "
"ditempel tidak memerlukannya."

